    "turn_text": "Now, that's the traditional version of a revolution. Well, the revolution has been going on for years. We're just seeing the culmination of it. It's a revolution against you and me. everything. You think the last five years, which just happened. I mean, look at everything. Look at everything that is upside down right now from CRD in schools to Donald Trump being rated to, you know, the election of 2020 to what happened in 2020, by the way, what happened the summer of 2020? You think that the revolution is coming. I hate to tell you this. I think we're knee deep in it already. And our reaction to it, our reaction to it is the fight. Not talking physical. I'm talking about refusing, saying no. Right now, you are nothing to the federal government. You are nothing more than a means of production and revenue. That's it. You are a means of production and revenue. And if you don't serve their political purposes, you are crap. And you will be persecuted. You will be cursed persecuted by the IRS. You will be persecuted possibly by the FBI. It will start with the IRS, by the way, with their 87,000 new agents. Listen, it doesn't take a genius to figure this stuff out. This isn't conspiracy theory stuff. They're literally, they're going to, the house is going to vote on it tomorrow. 87,000 new IRS agents, $400 billion spent on green energy nonsense and they're calling it the inflation reduction act. I mean, what the hell else do you need to know? What the hell else do you need to know? You're being played. You're being played. Dear God. I swear to you. This is Janine Pirro. I love Janine, by the way. She's spectacular. Here she is at 9-4 last talking about the rate on Modern Lago.",
